%% Source: backend/services/approval/README.md (ASCII state line + "Recovery" table) and
%% ThreePhaseCommitCoordinator. Drawn as a UML state machine: trigger [guard] / effect. Each state is written to the
%% coordinator log before the phase's messages are sent.
stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> WAITING_VOTES : approve / log tx, send CanCommit
    WAITING_VOTES --> PRECOMMITTING : [all votes YES] / send PreCommit
    WAITING_VOTES --> ABORTING : [a NO, timeout or error] / send Abort
    WAITING_VOTES --> ABORTED : recovery / send Abort
    PRECOMMITTING --> COMMITTING : [acks in or 5 s] / send DoCommit
    PRECOMMITTING --> COMMITTED : recovery / send DoCommit
    COMMITTING --> COMMITTED : [all DoCommit acked]
    COMMITTING --> COMMITTING : [an ack missing] recovery / resend DoCommit
    ABORTING --> ABORTED : Abort sent (or recovery)
    COMMITTED --> [*]
    ABORTED --> [*]
